# Butterfly transition — scene layout is source of truth

Pos / size / anchor of `FC_ButterflyTransition` live on the prefab instance in `PrologueVN.unity` (or prefab asset); không dùng scene sandbox.

1. Do not hard-code `anchoredPosition` / `sizeDelta` / Stretch in runtime apply when the object already exists.
2. Do not `SetSiblingIndex` on existing objects.
3. Seed Rect only when creating a new GameObject.
4. User tweaks Hierarchy then Ctrl+S.
5. Do not OpenScene over an unsaved sandbox just to attach missing objects.
6. Create missing children only — never rebuild/overwrite existing layout.
7. Do not add this sandbox to Build Settings.
